  "details": "Currently the only indication that your mic is working in game is through the mic icon which lights up when you speak. This isn’t enough information to inform us the quality and volume of our mics. With a volume meter, it would show us that our mics are too loud or too quiet, and if we have a lot of floor noise on our mics. This would greatly help us troubleshoot mic issues without having to ask other if our mics are working.",
